#: ../../../release/dev/msvc-preprocessor.rst:2
msgid "msvc-preprocessor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/msvc-preprocessor.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :prop_tgt:`C_EXTENSIONS` and :prop_tgt:`CXX_EXTENSIONS` target "
"properties are now honored by the ``MSVC`` compiler from Visual Studio 2019 "
"version 16.5 or above for selecting the preprocessor.  ``OFF`` adds the ``/"
"Zc:preprocessor`` flag, which selects the standard-conforming preprocessor.  "
"A target that uses both languages gets the flag for both if either one "
"disables extensions.  See policy :policy:`CMP0234`."
msgstr ""
